  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support IIEP 2003---</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programst&#xF6;d IIEP 2003---</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IIEP&apos;s mission is to aid countries to build their capacities to design, deliver, manage and monitor the education services.The capacity building consists of three core activities: 1) education and training, 2) research &amp; analysis,and dissemination of results ( in form of policy forums, books &amp; newsletters) and 3) service to UNESCO&apos;s Member States, through operational and field activities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IIEPs program syftar till att utbilda utbildningsplanerare fr&#xE5;n olika l&#xE4;nder, framf&#xF6;rallt utvecklingsl&#xE4;nder.IIEPs aktiviteter omfattar: 1) l&#xE5;nga och korta kurser, s&#xE5;v&#xE4;l i Paris som i vissa regioner och l&#xE4;nder, 2)forskning &amp; forskningsseminarier,och publicering av b&#xF6;cker och nyhetsbrev, och 3)service till UNESCOs medlemsl&#xE4;nder genom speciella uppdrag i enskilda l&#xE4;nder.</narrative>
  </description>
